<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.label>酒馆</HH_Venue_Tavern.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.description>客人在这里买一杯饮品并当场喝掉的房间。在货架或储存区放上啤酒或其他饮品；招牌或柜台后的酒保会保持营业。除非招牌另有说明，房间里的饮品只留给顾客。</HH_Venue_Tavern.description>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.label>商店</HH_Venue_Shop.label>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.description>客人在这里购买商品的房间。房间内货架和储存区里的所有东西都可出售，价格为市场价乘以招牌的价格系数。没有店员时，商店以小幅折扣自助经营。</HH_Venue_Shop.description>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.label>餐厅</HH_Venue_Restaurant.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.description>客人坐下来用餐的房间。有桌子、厨房和服务员，就成了餐厅；客人为这里货架和桌上的餐盘与餐食付费。菜肴由厨房烹饪；放久了的餐盘不再出售。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.description>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.label>赌场</HH_Venue_Casino.label>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.description>摆满牌桌、老虎机和荷官的房间。客人用银币参与机会游戏；庄家保留一个小而诚实的优势。</HH_Venue_Casino.description>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.label>水疗馆</HH_Venue_Spa.label>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.description>一个安静的房间，用于沐浴、蒸汽浴和休息。服务员负责保持毛巾温热；客人按次付费。</HH_Venue_Spa.description>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.label>休息室</HH_Venue_Lounge.label>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.description>带座位的候客室。发现营业场所关门或无人值守的客人会在这里等待，而不是堵在门口，并且等得更有耐心。始终开放，无需员工。</HH_Venue_Lounge.description>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>至少一台老虎机或一张赌桌。没有游戏的赌场只是个房间。</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>一台赌具</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>老虎机和亮灯的牌桌只有通电才能运转。</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>为赌具供电</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>赌桌需要荷官：一名启用了服务工作类型的殖民者。</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>一名荷官（服务工作）</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>坐得舒服的客人待得更久，下注也更大。每张赌桌周围标出的座位需要摆上椅子。</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>赌桌座位上的椅子</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>客人在兑换窗口把银币换成筹码，下注会更大一点。</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>一个兑换窗口</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.hint>光线充足的房间在天黑后显得更温馨。</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.label>一盏落地灯</HH_Venue_Casino.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.label>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>客人坐在这里等候。至少两个座位。</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>座位</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>可以放杯子的地方。</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>一张小桌</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>一点绿意能让任何房间更宜人。</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>一盆盆栽</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>光线充足的房间在天黑后显得更温馨。</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>一盏落地灯</HH_Venue_Lounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>客人坐下用餐；没有桌子的餐厅只是个厨房。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>一张桌子</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>桌边至少两把椅子。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>座位</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>房间里货架或桌上的烹饪菜肴都在菜单上。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>出售的餐盘</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>一名启用了服务工作类型的殖民者负责点单，让餐厅保持营业。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>一名服务员（服务工作）</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>柜台是服务员的岗位，也是当天营业款的存放处。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>一个柜台</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.hint>摆在货架上等候的餐盘上菜更快。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.label>一个放餐盘的货架</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.hint>至少八个座位，应付繁忙的夜晚。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.label>容纳人群的空间</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.label>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.hint>光线充足的房间在天黑后显得更温馨。</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.label>一盏落地灯</HH_Venue_Restaurant.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.label>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>房间内货架和储存区里的所有东西都可出售。</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>一个货架或储存区</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>把想卖的东西放进房间的储存空间。</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>货架上的商品</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>柜台后有店员时，商店按全价收费，而不是自助折扣价。</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>一个柜台</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>可选：由从事服务工作的殖民者出售，按全价收费，客人也更满意。</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>一名店员（服务工作）</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>光线充足的房间在天黑后显得更温馨。</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>一盏落地灯</HH_Venue_Shop.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>客人为热水浴缸、桑拿或按摩付费。</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>浴缸、桑拿房或按摩台</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>需要电力的设施只有通电才能使用。</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>为设施供电</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>一名启用了服务工作类型的殖民者负责照顾客人。</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>一名服务员（服务工作）</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>客人喜欢在泡澡和桑拿之间坐下歇一会儿。</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>休息用的座位</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>一点绿意能让任何房间更宜人。</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>一盆盆栽</HH_Venue_Spa.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>酒保站在柜台后，客人在这里点单。午夜时，当天的营业款会放在上面。荣誉制下不需要（无人服务）。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>一个柜台</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>客人坐在桌边喝酒，而不是站在门口。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>一张桌子</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>至少两个座位：椅子、凳子、扶手椅或长凳。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>座位</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.2.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>房间里存放的啤酒和其他饮品都可出售。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>备货的饮品</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.3.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>一名启用了服务工作类型的殖民者让酒馆保持营业。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>一名酒保（服务工作）</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.4.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.hint>货架上的饮品整齐，也便于补货。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.label>一个放饮品的货架</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.5.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.hint>至少六个座位，方便一群人一起进来。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.label>容纳人群的空间</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.6.label>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.hint>光线充足的房间在天黑后显得更温馨。</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.hint>
  <HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.label>一盏落地灯</HH_Venue_Tavern.modExtensions.1.requirements.7.label>
</LanguageData>
